Subject: [PATCH] tools: use /usr/bin/env bash shebangs

Buildroot's host build environment doesn't guarantee /bin/bash exists
(it doesn't on NixOS, which only has bash on PATH). These scripts
aren't part of the target build, just host-side codegen helpers, so
switching to an env lookup is safe.

--- a/tools/all_syscalls
+++ b/tools/all_syscalls
@@ -1 +1 @@
-#!/bin/bash
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
--- a/tools/all_errnos
+++ b/tools/all_errnos
@@ -1 +1 @@
-#!/bin/bash
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
